Subject: [PATCH] Step 5b: admin dashboard (/admin)

- Separate Arabic root layout, noindex, excluded from the locale proxy and robots
- In-memory access token + HttpOnly refresh cookie; shared refresh on expired-token 401, then retry
- Overview with stats, most-read articles and unread-messages badge
- Projects: bilingual side-by-side editor, Markdown preview with the site renderer, cover,
  gallery (multi-upload, alt text, reorder, delete), publish/hide/feature/delete
- Articles: editor with word counts, SEO overrides with length counters, cover, publish/hide/delete
- Messages: filters and search, open marks as read, reply by e-mail, mark unread, delete
- Account: profile, password change, sign out of all devices
- API error codes mapped to Arabic messages and per-field errors

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
